WEBVTT

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.760
Beyblade...

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.310
The world's most enjoyable battling top game!

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.310
The beys shot from their launchers,

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.360
and the Bladers' passions 
all collide in the stadium!

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.810
Beyblade Burst is...

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:28.430
...the story of the kids who do battle, 
entrusting their dreams to their Beys.

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:35.610
But right now, I'm gonna have fun!

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.440
Go Shoot!

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:55.150
Victory Valkyrie just keeps 
on attacking, over and over!

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:56.490
Rush Shoot!

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.230
Rush Shoot...!?

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:06.780
No way...

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:11.030
Yeah!

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:14.670
We did it, Valkyrie! It's our first win!

00:01:15.390 --> 00:01:17.480
Let's keep it going, partner!

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.460
<i>Beyblade! Let's go</i>

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.460
<i>Beyblade! Hajimeyou</i>

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:33.930
<i>Become the ultimate Blader</i>

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:33.930
<i>mezasou ze, saikyou no blader</i>

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:39.510
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:39.510
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:44.390
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:44.390
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:48.650
<i>Yeah, everyone's got it</i>

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:48.650
<i>kitto, dare datte mottenda</i>

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:55.740
<i>The desire to win... and a Beyblade just for them!</i>

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:55.740
<i>kachitaitte kanjou to... kimi dake no beibureedo!</i>

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:58.660
<i>That's right, facing each other now</i>

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:58.660
<i>sou, mukiatta hyoujou ni</i>

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:05.790
<i>The will to become stronger starts boiling up, right?</i>

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:05.790
<i>tsuyoku naritaitte kimochi ga hora, uzumaitendarou?</i>

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:12.010
<i>Shoot! The throbbing of your spinning dreams (Burst!)</i>

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:12.010
<i>SHOOT! mawari dashita yume no kodou</i>

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:16.510
<i>Burn (Burst!) strong (Burst!), your hearts pound</i>

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:16.510
<i>atsuku hajike, takanariau</i>

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:18.720
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:18.720
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:21.430
<i>When two people (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:21.430
<i>zettai katsundatte iu</i>

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:23.730
<i>who've got the drive to win (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:23.730
<i>honki no omoi doushi ga</i>

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:25.730
<i>battle it out (Burst! Burst! Burst! Burst!)</i>

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:25.730
<i>butsukattara</i>

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:28.900
<i>bonds are formed (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:28.900
<i>kizuna ga umareru no sa</i>

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:31.570
<i>When it's time for the climax (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:31.570
<i>ketteiteki shunkan</i>

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:34.030
<i>face it off... together! (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:34.030
<i>oikakeyou... issho ni!</i>

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:39.320
<i>Can't stop, I'll finish this, with the! best! (Go!)</i>

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:39.320
<i>mou tomaranai, kimeru no sa  sai! kyou!</i>

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:43.040
<i>Burst Finish!</i>

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:43.040
<i>Baasuto Finisshu o!</i>

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.540
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.540
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:53.540
Kerbeus: 
Guard Dog of the Underworld!!

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:58.740
Everyone, listen up! I'm Valt Aoi.

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:03.450
I won the first round of the wbba. 
Regionals with incredible ease!

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:08.840
Victory Valkyrie's new technique, 
Rush Shoot, is unbeatable!

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.580
Rush Shoot! Rush Shoot!

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:19.620
Hey, hurry up! Don't you know what time it is!?

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:24.670
Rush! Rush! Rush!

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.790
Stop that, Valt!

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:28.360
O-Oh, Mom!

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:30.560
"O-Oh, Mom!" my butt!

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.870
Tokonatsu and Nika already went to school!

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:35.690
Oh, crap! See you when I get home!

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:37.650
Have a good day.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:41.590
Jeez, mornings are always like this with him.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.680
I'll be late, late, late...

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:53.780
Just made it!!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.730
Phew, I made it.

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:59.220
Acting like an idiot even this early, Valt?

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:02.330
Oh, Honcho! You come to school early?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.060
You're just late!

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:05.590
Oh, yeah...

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:09.700
Really, did I really lose to someone as dumb as you?

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:14.720
Oh yeah, I totally won!

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:16.500
It was even a Burst win!

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:19.480
Your Ragnaruk just burst into pieces!

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.830
The way I won was so cool, wasn't it?

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:25.690
Hey! You just won the first round, so don't get cocky!

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:29.650
No, I'm not cocky at all! It's just how strong I am!

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:33.890
Rush Shoot! Rush Shoot!

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:33.890
--That's exactly what being cocky is!

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.560
Valt!

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:37.430
We saw yesterday's match!

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:39.890
It was a Burst, too! Sorry I ever doubted you!

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:42.070
Oh, thank you, thank you!

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:44.270
The move you used at the end was amazing!

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.780
Rush Shoot, wasn't it?

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:47.660
Oh, you got it?

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:49.720
If you wanna see it, I can show you!

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.270
Show us, show us!

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:55.030
Hey, you all! Class is starting soon!

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:56.320
Oh, Principal!

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:58.230
Okay, then after school, alright?

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:58.930
Yeah!

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:02.120
Jeez, I hate that Valt...

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:35.190
Rush Shoot! Rush Shoot!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.830
Bro's in a pretty good mood, isn't he?

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.580
He's quite pleased.

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:41.750
Well, duh!

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:43.840
I beat Honcho with a Burst,

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:46.020
And everyone's telling me how awesome I am!

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:47.720
Hey!

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:51.410
You're a bit too old to be acting 
like Pinocchio over there!

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:53.910
Pinocchio! Pinocchio!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:55.700
I'm gonna make you cry, you idiot!

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.000
Keep quiet!

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:00.990
Shu!

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:01.900
Quiet!

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:04.570
Go Shoot!

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:11.650
All right.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:14.530
Don't be so serious, man!

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:16.500
Woah, Shu!

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:17.970
You're sweating all over!

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:20.930
I've been practicing my blading. 
Of course I would be.

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.660
Practicing your blading...?

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:24.920
Woah, look at that!

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:25.980
Sweat...?

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.610
Is Shu really covered all over...?

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:30.990
How much did he practice...?

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:34.390
Woah, that's a lot.

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:35.700
WOAH!

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:39.430
I... I really don't get it, but...

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:43.280
This just... makes me really frustrated...

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.590
Big brother hates losing.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:47.270
Yeah.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:49.860
Well, I'm good too!

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:53.460
I'll practice more and more and 
win the tourney with the Rush Shoot!

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:54.470
No way.

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:56.240
Why!?

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:00.940
Someone who's full of himself just for winning once...

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:01.920
won't win again.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:06.140
Don't underestimate Beyblade.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:10.080
He's as unlikable as ever.

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:13.930
Hey, Shu! You didn't have to say it like that, you know!

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:17.030
You're an idiot, Shu!

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:17.940
--His voice is so loud...

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:20.920
I'll definitely be the champ!

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:26.660
Everyone, be sure and watch closely!

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:29.900
I'm gonna show you the best Rush Shoot ever!

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:33.820
Okay!

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:37.330
Three, two, one...

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:39.590
Go Shoot!

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:45.040
The Bey's coming back to the center!

00:07:45.050 --> 00:07:46.680
Oh, it's coming again!

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:48.950
And again, to the center!

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:51.220
I've never seen anything like this!

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:52.910
Yes!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:54.610
This is a rush!

00:07:54.610 --> 00:07:55.540
Amazing!

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:59.800
Awesome, right? No matter the Bey, 
I'll burst it into pieces!

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:03.250
I'll send even Shu's Spriggan flying!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.110
He's way too cocky!

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:11.300
Hey, Valt! Fight me one more time!

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:15.860
Oh, sure, sure! Though I'll win every time.

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:17.460
Yesterday was a fluke!

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:18.680
How was it a fluke!?

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:22.610
Grr... Just because you won once because of a fluke...

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:26.500
don't get so cocky, you idiot!

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:30.340
Who cares about that Rush Shoot!

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:31.410
This time, I'll win!

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:34.600
My Valkyrie won't lose to you!

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:38.820
First battle! Ready, set!

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:41.310
Three!

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:42.650
Two!

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:43.970
One!

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:46.630
Go Shoot!

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.820
Go, Rush Shoot!

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:57.560
Huh?

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.260
Not yet!

00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:00.900
Valkyrie, rush!

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:02.520
I wonder if it can.

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:04.230
What happened?

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.800
It's different from before!

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:08.250
It hit the wall!

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:13.230
Valkyrie, what's going on!?

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.040
Ragnaruk, counter!

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:19.520
Send it flying!

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:23.080
What!?

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.020
No way!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.930
Ragnaruk, Burst Finish.

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:30.590
2 points, so the Boss wins!

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:34.160
Wow, a Burst Finish! Feels good!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.150
Some Rush Shoot!

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:39.060
Yesterday was a fluke, you get it now!?

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:41.170
Whew, that felt good.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:43.350
Valkyrie...

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:47.610
Your Rush Shoot's still way too unstable.

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:53.620
<i>Someone happy with just winning their first match</i>

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.050
<i>won't win again.</i>

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:59.600
I'm sorry, Valkyrie...

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.530
I wonder if Bro feels bad...

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:14.760
Rush Shoot did fail after all...

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:17.780
Tokonatsu. Nika.

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:19.070
What?

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:21.600
Was I... being cocky?

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.290
Yeah.

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:26.790
So I was...

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:30.250
I'm an idiot!

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:34.360
Practice, practice, more practice!

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:36.590
What is it?

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:40.590
Look at this...

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:42.820
It looks like big brother!

00:10:44.150 --> 00:10:46.850
Three, two, one...

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:48.700
Go Shoot!

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:52.010
Three, two! one...

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:54.230
Go Shoot!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:56.800
Basics!

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.270
Okay, next are push-ups!

00:10:59.270 --> 00:11:05.290
Basics! Basics! Basics!

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:07.930
Bro!

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.310
Big brother!

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:13.340
Bro, there's a puppet show at the mall right now.

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:16.590
And there's a puppet that looks just like you!

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:18.410
He's the hero!

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:20.450
A puppet of me that's the hero?

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.880
It looks awesome!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:24.740
C'mon, let's go see it!

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:27.490
Wait, stop! Don't pull on me!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.060
Here it is!

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:32.360
It's still going on!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.490
Waahahaha!

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:38.620
With this sword, I can't lose to someone like you!

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:41.550
For someone who's so full of himself,

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:42.930
victory is doubtful!

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:44.470
What!?

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:46.230
It's just like him!

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:49.340
It's saying exactly what Shu said, too.

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:51.740
Don't lose, Hero!

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:53.170
Take this!

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:57.280
He's so weak.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:59.350
He's down with just one hit.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:01.720
What're you doing, Hero!? Fight back!

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:03.230
This is it!

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:04.580
Stop right there!

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:05.460
Right there!

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.420
Keru! Besu!

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:11.620
Hero, you can't be so full of yourself.

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:14.370
If you're such a Hero, then get up!

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:16.300
Yeah! Charge!

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:18.580
What're you doin'?

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:19.490
Get it together!

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:21.110
What is this?

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:24.270
Hero, you're too weak!

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:27.020
We'll defeat the dragon for you!

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:30.260
You can do it, Keru, Besu!

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:33.060
Come on, Hero! Get up!

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:35.450
The Hero's the one who beats the dragon, y'know!

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:37.490
Bro's back to normal, huh?

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:38.900
Yep. We did it!

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:53.630
That puppet show was really funny!

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:55.110
That's good.

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:57.760
Keru and Besu were so cute and funny!

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.370
I wish Dad could've seen it.

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:02.210
Hey, where's Dad flying now?

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:05.320
It's a round-trip to New York, so...

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:08.120
Above Alaska, probably?

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.140
Alaska, huh?

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.720
Being a pilot must be fun, being able to go places.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.750
Oh yeah, and there was a Hero 
that looked just like bro!

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:17.280
And he sucked, too.

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:18.160
Wasn't like me.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:18.950
He totally was.

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.920
Right down to losing in one hit!

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:22.640
Right?

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:24.690
I said he wasn't like me!

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:31.900
He really wasn't like me!

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:37.750
Is big brother's match soon?

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.140
It's close to starting!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.210
Oh, Shu!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:44.030
So you wanted to see this match too, huh?

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:44.910
Pretty much.

00:13:45.310 --> 00:13:46.910
Even if it was a fluke,

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:50.380
he still managed to beat me, one of the top players.

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:52.200
You can't leave him be either, can you?

00:13:54.590 --> 00:13:56.700
He's acting like he won or something.

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:01.020
Okay, boys and girls!

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:05.900
The second round of the Beigoma 
Beyblade regionals is starting soon!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:08.160
Is everyone ready!?

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.240
Yeah!

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:14.160
He won his first match against 
Rantaro Kiyama, a favorite to win!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.510
The Dark Horse!

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:18.810
It's Valt Aoi!

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:23.400
Dark Horse... what's that?

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:26.150
You don't even know that?

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:27.870
Wait, what is it?

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.650
Someone no one thought would win.

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:33.130
Someone people are expecting a lot from!

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:34.450
Me...?

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:39.530
Valt! Valt! Valt!

00:14:39.530 --> 00:14:42.400
I'm being cheered for... Hehe...

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:46.740
All right! Today, I'm gonna go wild!

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:50.220
That Valt, he's getting cocky again!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:52.190
It's a bad habit of his.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.940
Are you worrying about big brother?

00:14:57.010 --> 00:14:59.240
No freaking way!

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:01.610
Why would I ever worry about him!?

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:03.490
Thanks, Honcho.

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:05.250
I told you, I'm not!

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:08.170
And the person facing Valt Aoi is...

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:11.310
Kensuke Midorikawa!

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:16.930
So he's my competition, huh?

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.280
He's got such a stupid face right now.

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:21.280
You're one to talk!

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:23.800
But you've got the same face as I do, Keru!

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:26.680
No I don't! It's clearly different!

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:28.950
Oh, it's those puppets from before!

00:15:29.230 --> 00:15:30.450
I'm Keru.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.080
And I'm Besu.

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:34.930
Valt Aoi, you can't win against me.

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:36.990
We'll be the winners!

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:40.550
Wow! The puppets are really talking!

00:15:41.030 --> 00:15:43.160
Puppets can't talk...

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:45.390
He's a ventriloquist, isn't he?

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:51.040
Let's do this, Kaiser Kerbeus!

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:52.830
Kaiser Kerbeus...

00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:56.770
It's Layer is rounder than my Ragnaruk's...

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.340
It's probably a Defense Type.

00:15:58.860 --> 00:15:59.920
Defense...?

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:02.080
So it's good at protecting itself.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:02.720
Yeah.

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:04.910
It doesn't matter what Bey you've got!

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.050
I've got my Rush Shoot.

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:09.070
I'll take you out in one hit!

00:16:09.350 --> 00:16:12.230
That idiot! He's getting full of himself again...

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:16.670
Spin Finish and Over Finish 
are both worth one point.

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:18.640
Burst Finish is two.

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:20.950
The first to get two points wins.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.120
First battle!

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:28.070
Ready, set!

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:31.210
Let's do this!

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:33.630
Three!

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.130
Two!

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:36.520
One!

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:39.010
Go Shoot!

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:50.890
Oh, no! Valkyrie's too slanted, 
and it's slamming against the stadium!

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:55.940
This isn't a Rush Shoot, it's a Mis-Shoot!

00:16:57.100 --> 00:17:00.690
Oh man, that idiot! It's because he got too cocky!

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:02.510
He's hopeless...

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:05.200
Rush Shoot is a high-risk technique.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:08.350
If you aren't concentrating hard, you'll fail it.

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:11.720
He aimed that launch too far down.

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:13.400
No way...

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:14.270
Big brother...

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:17.590
Keep it together, Valkyrie!

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:19.990
That's it!

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.970
It recovered with its spin speed.

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.670
Valkyrie managed to recover its stance,

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:26.880
and is now heading to attack Kerbeus!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:28.650
What!?

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:33.290
Valkyrie's attacks aren't affecting Kerbeus at all!

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:36.390
Your attacks don't do anything to Kerbeus!

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:40.600
Kaiser Kerbeus's heavy defensive layers

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:43.360
completely nullify Valkyrie's attacks!

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:46.130
Go!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:12.990
Valkyrie has stopped spinning!

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:16.190
Kaiser Kerbeus, Spin Finish!

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:22.130
Spin... Finish...?

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:25.870
Wow, this guy's all talk, who'd've thought?

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:28.630
My Kerbeus is insanely strong.

00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:29.330
Mine too.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:29.930
Yup.

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:36.090
What am I doing... making mistakes 
in such an important battle...

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:42.130
I'm sorry, Valkyrie... I'm sorry!

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:46.560
I thought that by practicing 
just one day I'd be good...

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:50.830
Shu practices for days and days!

00:18:52.590 --> 00:18:59.000
Daina. Looks like your Deathscyther's 
next victim is gonna be that plushie lover.

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:03.090
Battles are won by whoever wants to win the most.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:07.230
Yeah, but that newbie's just all talk.

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:09.630
He's just gonna fail at the Rush Shoot again.

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:12.960
He's still got some fire left in his eyes.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:14.140
Huh?

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:17.730
What...?

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:22.640
This is the real fight...

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:24.240
This battle...

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:26.350
isn't over yet!

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:27.810
Valt...

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:31.810
Now, Valt Aoi has one point left until he loses!

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:34.610
How will this second battle turn out!?

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:40.370
One more time, Valkyrie! 
Let's do another Rush Shoot!

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:46.320
What!? What!? He's saying he's 
gonna do another Rush Shoot!

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:50.210
What is that idiot doing!? 
He's just gonna fail again!

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:52.090
Yeah, just give up!

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:53.200
You'll fail!

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:53.790
Give up!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.200
Just shoot normally!

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:57.670
Will bro be okay...?

00:19:57.680 --> 00:19:58.670
Big brother...

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:03.540
Everyone's booing at Valt Aoi's recklessness!

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:11.650
Shut up!

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:16.220
I'll definitely do it this time, so shut up and watch!

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:17.200
Bro...

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:18.360
Big brother!

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:23.080
If I give up now, as Valkyrie's partner...

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:24.640
I'd be a disgrace!

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:28.130
I...

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.650
don't want Valkyrie to hate me!

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:33.840
That's right, Valt.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:34.980
Challenge yourself.

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:37.330
Face it together with your Bey.

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:41.550
Valkyrie, believe in me!

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:43.760
It'll be the same every time.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:46.090
I wonder how he'll fail this time?

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:51.150
Kaiser Kerbeus is a Defense Type, 
so it's strong against Attack Types.

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:53.020
I can't wait to see!

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:54.880
Second battle!

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:56.930
Ready, set!

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:58.510
Three!

00:20:58.510 --> 00:21:00.020
Two!

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:01.320
One!

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:03.750
Go Shoot!

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:13.470
Oh my God! The Bey's becoming slanted again!

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:17.070
He did it again...

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:21.120
Valkyrie!

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:31.250
Wow! Valkyrie regained its stance!

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:34.590
Go!

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:36.970
It's circling the stadium fast!

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:39.090
And now it's going in for the attack!

00:21:39.570 --> 00:21:41.160
This movement...

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:43.140
It's the Rush Shoot!

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:44.750
Yes!

00:21:44.760 --> 00:21:47.220
It's here, the Rush Shoot!

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:49.520
Go, go, go, go, go!

00:21:48.260 --> 00:21:49.520
Honcho...

00:21:49.730 --> 00:21:51.500
Yep, he's cheering him on.

00:21:54.140 --> 00:21:54.910
Here it comes!

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:59.300
Keep going and knock Kerbeus right out!

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:25.050
<i>With huge hopes stuffed in my bag</i>

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:25.050
<i>ookina kibou wo baggu ni tsumekonde</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:31.540
<i>The train set off towards the future</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:31.540
<i>ressha wa mirai e ima hashiri dashita</i>

00:22:31.720 --> 00:22:37.140
<i>Holding the ticket to my dreams close</i>

00:22:31.720 --> 00:22:37.140
<i>yume no kippu wo gyutto nigirishimete</i>

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:46.300
<i>I move forward, without a doubt in my mind</i>

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:46.300
<i>osorezu ni susumu mou keshite mayowanai kara</i>

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:50.740
<i>On these long and winding rails</i>

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:50.740
<i>hatenaku tsuzuku nagai reeru</i>

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:53.900
<i>Where you get off is up to you</i>

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:53.900
<i>shuuchakuten wa jibun de kimeru</i>

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:56.210
<i>Chase it, chase it</i>

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:56.210
<i>oikakete oikakete</i>

00:22:56.250 --> 00:23:00.470
<i>I know your dreams will come true some day</i>

00:22:56.250 --> 00:23:00.470
<i>mieru keshiki ga aru to boku wa shinjiteru</i>

00:23:00.610 --> 00:23:06.210
<i>Run, keep running, run far</i>

00:23:00.610 --> 00:23:06.210
<i>hashitte hashiri tsuzukete, kakenukeru</i>

00:23:06.380 --> 00:23:10.340
<i>Get past the countless tears</i>

00:23:06.380 --> 00:23:10.340
<i>ikutsumo no namida o koete</i>

00:23:10.430 --> 00:23:13.320
<i>so we can be stronger</i>

00:23:10.430 --> 00:23:13.320
<i>bokura wa tsuyoku naru</i>

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:19.050
<i>Some day we'll get glory, so until then</i>

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:19.050
<i>itsuka eikou o tsukamu sono hi made</i>

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:22.610
<i>Turn your dreams into reality</i>

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:22.610
<i>yume wa yume no mama janai</i>

00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:26.960
<i>Our endless adventure continues</i>

00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:26.960
<i>owarinai tabi wa tsuzuku</i>

00:23:35.770 --> 00:23:37.920
Am I really that cocky?

00:23:37.920 --> 00:23:41.110
It's not like me to show off 
just because I won one time..

00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:42.770
But really, haha...

00:23:42.770 --> 00:23:47.730
I'm gonna keep attacking non-stop and beat 
Kerbeus no matter what kind of Bey it is!

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:49.730
By the way, what does being cocky even mean?

00:23:50.520 --> 00:23:54.150
Next time on Beyblade Burst: 
"Blast-Off! Rush Shoot!!"

00:23:54.690 --> 00:23:57.270
Three, two, one...

00:23:57.270 --> 00:23:59.530
Go Shoot!
